      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 5.23,
          "en": "So, obviously, we need a back end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.23,
          "end": 6.663,
          "en": "Now creating a back end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.663,
          "end": 9.548,
          "en": "that is something you could take an entire course on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.548,
          "end": 12.328,
          "en": "because for writing server side code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.328,
          "end": 15.42,
          "en": "for writing code that runs on a server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.42,
          "end": 18.35,
          "en": "and for connecting a database to that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.35,
          "end": 20.88,
          "en": "There are dedicated programming languages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.88,
          "end": 23.5,
          "en": "like Node.js or PHP.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.5,
          "end": 24.58,
          "en": "And you can for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.58,
          "end": 27.673,
          "en": "take my Node.js course if you want to learn all about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.66,
          "end": 30.827,
          "en": "This course focuses on view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.827,
          "end": 33.33,
          "en": "and therefore I want to keep that focus",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.33,
          "end": 37.06,
          "en": "so we're not going to write our own server side code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.06,
          "end": 39.08,
          "en": "Instead we're going to use Firebase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.08,
          "end": 42.39,
          "en": "which is a service that gives us a back end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.39,
          "end": 44.96,
          "en": "where we don't have to write any code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.96,
          "end": 47.042,
          "en": "to get started with storing data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.042,
          "end": 49.98,
          "en": "I will emphasize though that this is not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.98,
          "end": 52.07,
          "en": "just a database which we're using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.07,
          "end": 53.971,
          "en": "It's a complete back end service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.971,
          "end": 56.56,
          "en": "It is like if you had your own server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.56,
          "end": 58.167,
          "en": "with your own logic on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.167,
          "end": 60.77,
          "en": "Just in this case, already pre-written",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.77,
          "end": 62.403,
          "en": "and pre-configured for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.53,
          "end": 65.788,
          "en": "The good thing about Firebase, which is a service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.788,
          "end": 68.96000000000001,
          "en": "offered by Google, is that you can get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.96000000000001,
          "end": 70.56,
          "en": "for free with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 73.827,
          "en": "You can start for free and what we're going to do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 73.827,
          "end": 76.18,
          "en": "is possible for free.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.18,
          "end": 77.992,
          "en": "And that's why I'm using this service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77.992,
          "end": 82.83,
          "en": "All you need for this service is a Google account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.83,
          "end": 84.44,
          "en": "So make sure you create one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.44,
          "end": 87.53999999999999,
          "en": "and then log in here into that console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.53999999999999,
          "end": 89.313,
          "en": "into the Firebase console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.46000000000001,
          "end": 93.97999999999999,
          "en": "Once you are logged in and in this Firebase console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.97999999999999,
          "end": 96.34,
          "en": "you can add a new project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.34,
          "end": 97.926,
          "en": "and give it any name of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.926,
          "end": 100.69,
          "en": "I'll name it vue-http-demo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.69,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "but this name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 104.75999999999999,
          "en": "Click continue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 104.75999999999999,
          "end": 106.00999999999999,
          "en": "You can disable this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 106.00999999999999,
          "end": 108.28999999999999,
          "en": "you don't need that here, the analytics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 108.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.53,
          "en": "And then create this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 110.53,
          "end": 113.8,
          "en": "Now Firebase is a service that has way more to offer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 113.8,
          "end": 116.31,
          "en": "than what we are going to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 116.31,
          "end": 119.453,
          "en": "Nonetheless it has all we need here to have a dummy back end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 119.453,
          "end": 122.48,
          "en": "and that's why we're going to be using it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 122.48,
          "end": 125.07,
          "en": "We're also going to use this Firebase service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 125.07,
          "end": 128.53,
          "en": "in a way that is typical for communicating with a back end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.53,
          "end": 131.01,
          "en": "So that what you learn here will also apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131.01,
          "end": 133.75,
          "en": "to any other back end you might be using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.75,
          "end": 135.848,
          "en": "That's another reason why I chose Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 135.848,
          "end": 139.66,
          "en": "So now, we're in the Firebase console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 139.66,
          "end": 142.141,
          "en": "and here we want to go to database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 142.141,
          "end": 145.075,
          "en": "because we are going to use the database part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.075,
          "end": 147,
          "en": "of the Firebase service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 147,
          "end": 149.02,
          "en": "It's just one of the offerings they have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 149.02,
          "end": 151.51,
          "en": "but here we need a database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 151.51,
          "end": 154.477,
          "en": "And we are not going to use the Cloud Firestore here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 154.477,
          "end": 157.14,
          "en": "but instead this real time database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 157.14,
          "end": 159.14,
          "en": "It's bit easier to use and it has",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 159.14,
          "end": 161.91,
          "en": "a nice rest API which is a specific",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 161.91,
          "end": 166.643,
          "en": "interface we can use for sending our http request to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 166.643,
          "end": 170.28,
          "en": "It's very easy to use and therefore a great choice here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 170.28,
          "end": 172.57999999999998,
          "en": "So let's create such a real time database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 172.57999999999998,
          "end": 174.713,
          "en": "and make sure you start in test mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 175.62,
          "end": 176.633,
          "en": "Click enable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 178.93,
          "end": 180.14,
          "en": "and here we go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 180.14,
          "end": 182.67,
          "en": "Now, you should see something like this on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 182.67,
          "end": 185.483,
          "en": "and for the moment that is all we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 185.483,
          "end": 187.4,
          "en": "Now let's leave it at that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 187.4,
          "end": 190.34,
          "en": "and let's go back to our view app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 190.34,
          "end": 192.6,
          "en": "And here, we are now going to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
